    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out our friends!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/3f7d7fcb4f3a03fb0ce616f8b421315d.avif?t=1735422323\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own animal character, or even a monstrosity!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/dd8422c6c57782f40096f7424f349b3d.poster.avif?t=1735422323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/dd8422c6c57782f40096f7424f349b3d.webm?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/dd8422c6c57782f40096f7424f349b3d.mp4?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make a little creature, and then watch them run around, interact with each other, and play.<br>Mii Channel meets Animal Crossing in this creative and relaxing sandbox!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/04d4c9a8492155d9ea0074d821bffee3.poster.avif?t=1735422323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/04d4c9a8492155d9ea0074d821bffee3.webm?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/04d4c9a8492155d9ea0074d821bffee3.mp4?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create A Huge Variety Of Characters!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/6599b1637773c9f6842f747a10ff5317.poster.avif?t=1735422323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/6599b1637773c9f6842f747a10ff5317.webm?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/6599b1637773c9f6842f747a10ff5317.mp4?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Easily share your creations with friends and dress them up in lil outfits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/a4d3bddfdbba0ba099c128635a1fdb19.webp?t=1735422323\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/0d43074ef43abc4869ba66b284ef8a01.webp?t=1735422323\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own animal character, or even a monstrosity!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/dd8422c6c57782f40096f7424f349b3d.poster.avif?t=1735422323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/dd8422c6c57782f40096f7424f349b3d.webm?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/dd8422c6c57782f40096f7424f349b3d.mp4?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make a little creature, and then watch them run around, interact with each other, and play.<br>Mii Channel meets Animal Crossing in this creative and relaxing sandbox!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/04d4c9a8492155d9ea0074d821bffee3.poster.avif?t=1735422323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/04d4c9a8492155d9ea0074d821bffee3.webm?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/04d4c9a8492155d9ea0074d821bffee3.mp4?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create A Huge Variety Of Characters!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/6599b1637773c9f6842f747a10ff5317.poster.avif?t=1735422323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/6599b1637773c9f6842f747a10ff5317.webm?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/6599b1637773c9f6842f747a10ff5317.mp4?t=1735422323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Easily share your creations with friends and dress them up in lil outfits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/a4d3bddfdbba0ba099c128635a1fdb19.webp?t=1735422323\" /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295120/extras/0d43074ef43abc4869ba66b284ef8a01.webp?t=1735422323\" /></span>",
